              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This repository makes available parts of the data used in: Preuss, S., & Max, M.M. (in press). Do firms put their money where their mouth is? Sociopolitical claims and corporate political activity. Accounting, Organizations and Society, 101510. Specifically, it contains:\n<ul>\n<li> environmental and diversity claims scores (2010-2020) \n<li> politicians covered by the Human Rights Campaign (HRC) and the League of Conservation Voters (LCV), including their Federal Election Committee (FEC), Votesmart and Charles Stewart congressional committee identifiers; this data includes all HRC/LCV rated politicians that we could locate in the FEC dataset \"Contributions from committees to candidate\" (111th-116th Congress)\n</ul>\n\n<b> Please cite the paper if you use the data in your work.</b>"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
